        "id": 1122423
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-27T20:17:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that it would be better to use CIL_SYN_STRING | CIL_SYN_LIST and allow an expression. This would allow (expandtypeattribute (all) false) to not expand any attributes as one useful example.\n\nThis shouldn\u0027t be too hard cil_gen_expr() will do most of the work in cil_build_ast.c. It might require a bit more work in cil_post.c",
      "revId": "843da387adae4b64cbf267acfce67ff8688cf306",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e69cf848_4a73759e",
        "filename": "libsepol/cil/src/cil_build_ast.c",
