        "id": 1122423
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-28T16:05:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I realize now that allowing an expression here would be way too much work. I was thinking of type expressions, but this would be an attribute expression.\n\nAllowing a list of attributes would still work though.",
      "parentUuid": "0e24017f_075751f0",
      "revId": "843da387adae4b64cbf267acfce67ff8688cf306",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
